          <li id="ref-balassa">Balassa, B. (1965). Trade liberalisation and "revealed" comparative
          advantage. <i>The Manchester School</i> 33(2), 99–123.
          doi:10.1111/j.1467-9957.1965.tb00050.x</li>
          <li id="ref-atlas">The Growth Lab at Harvard University. Growth Projections and Complexity
          Rankings, V6. Harvard Dataverse. doi:10.7910/DVN/XTAQMC. Columns
