        <p class="repro">Sections 4–6 and 9 use an ECI re-implementation independent of the case's
        own; it reproduces the case's published rank to a mean of
        {sig(A.reproduction.meanAbsRankDiff, 1)} places over {A.nYears} years. Data vintage: BACI
        release {A.release}, trade through {A.vintage}. The rank-correlation threshold, the rank
        acceptance window, the export tolerance and the nickel-import hypotheses were all fixed and
        recorded in advance of the results they judge; this review changed none of them.</p>
      </section>

